e passionate. Tsundere-type. \n\nGreen: noble daughter, amateur novelist, no friends.\n\nGold: heroine-type girl, cheat skill character. Gives unconditional love.\n\nBlack: noble daughter, commander girl. Gives conditional love only.\n\nWhite: stoic genius mage. Cares more for self. Star magician.\n\nPink: chaotic shrine maiden. Cares more for others. Rain dancer, rainbow maker.\n\nSilver:  overworked holy sister. Flawless qualities, has bad luck.\n\nPurple: 1st princess “Cattleya”. A gentle but lonely girl. Queen of orchids.\n\nOrange: 2nd princess, “Rosalind”. Younger sister villainous type. Orange rose.\n\nDark-blue: royal maid, retainer, professional shirker.\n\nDark-red: professional assassin, retainer, common-sense girl.\n\nAnything is fine! \n\nThank you for your time!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tg-HEjnr8RJ8h-nrW-Um0YfQxp22FEg7", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@birne_illust/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 734432, "client_id": 1711558, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/78795c4c/uploads/origins/70a544d0-9b91-4e44-a014-35bc9bb66886?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff2f57720a337f324f01fbe735271e00", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/78795c4c/uploads/origins/70a544d0-9b91-4e44-a014-35bc9bb66886?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff2f57720a337f324f01fbe735271e00, https://si.imgix.net/78795c4c/uploads/origins/70a544d0-9b91-4e44-a014-35bc9bb66886?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=367db062b39e308cdb7a44a9bda66d87 2x, https://si.imgix.net/78795c4c/uploads/origins/70a544d0-9b91-4e44-a014-35bc9bb66886?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2474676b6419c38188fc67015c0943f6 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, 